		{
			"id":"d2d4484d4ab4d76f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"A = 1\nB = 2\nC = 3\nX = 24\nY = 25\nZ = 26",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2320,
			"y":-460,
			"width":120,
			"height":180,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"d6bae8738a5d397d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"X = 1\nY = 2\nZ = 3\nA = 4\nB = 5\nC = 6",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2460,
			"y":-460,
			"width":120,
			"height":180,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"b38e1ab41da3f1f1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Theories\n1. New Clue book says that four books are relevant\n\t1. The Red Prince\n\t2. A New Clue\n\t3. The Fixed Stars\n\t4. Realm & Rune\n2. The book also says that we should look from the cover all the way through.\n3. Page count starts from the Title Page (unsure if before or after)\n4. If you use the Magnifying Glass on the words of the book, there are small numbers in it",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1970,
			"y":-1660,
			"width":749,
			"height":300,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{"id":"c8c8b83b6f515984","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_8orIns2Kga.png","x":-1840,"y":-400,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"8b6addff69ac1007","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_hzSZTtdu6z.png","x":1160,"y":-1440,"width":782,"height":440},
		{
			"id":"04280b3d6b34b456",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Metro Stops\n1. 8 - Royal Station\n2. 7 - Angel Tower\n3. 3 - Aries Crossing\n4. 10 - Tanner Fork\n5. 1 - Oris Train Hall\n6. 13- Dead End",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1400,
			"y":-980,
			"width":542,
			"height":260,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"0823e18217bb395c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# A New Clue - Low Case Clues\n\nOn Page 5:\n\n1 - All\n2 - Checked\n3 - Corner\n4 - Case\n5 - Rooms\n6 - Had\n7 - A\n8 - Low\n9 - Case\n10 - Clue\n11 - Found\n12 - In\n13 - The\n14 - Rooms\n\n**Patio** - **buried**\n**Nook** - **beside**\n**Office** - **west**\n**Pantry** - **bridgette**\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2740,
			"y":-1580,
			"width":500,
			"height":820,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"54d010aa961e1812","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_Gh6ka0vqOE.png","x":3320,"y":-1330,"width":400,"height":281},
		{
			"id":"5a570a23c87d4043",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# The Suspect Is Minor\nThere is a video with a Metro route that ends at the Dead End.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1400,
			"y":-685,
			"width":542,
			"height":125,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{"id":"d1b77b53253a76cd","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_JXuhH4xihX.png","x":3320,"y":-1622,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"4ebb56c6d0d61c97",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n\nRED -  PAGE A WORD X = Clue Low\nGREEN - PAGE C WORD A = The Clue\nVIOLET - PAGE B WORD Y = All A\nBLUE - PAGE Z WORD X = Corner Low",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2400,
			"y":-720,
			"width":500,
			"height":140,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"6bd9a56e731c4dd5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Signs in the Book\n\nRoute 8\nDepart \nKeep Left\nTo Tanner Fork\nTurn Right\nDead End\nRecord\nEach\nStop\nOn The Way\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1970,
			"y":-1330,
			"width":749,
			"height":360,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"48c03c126dc882c1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Stops to Words\n1. 8 - Royal Station - Low - X\n2. 7 - Angel Tower - A - Y\n3. 3 - Aries Crossing -  Corner - Z\n4. 10 - Tanner Fork - Clue - A\n5. 1 - Oris Train Hall - All - B\n6. 13 - Dead End - The - C",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1970,
			"y":-925,
			"width":410,
			"height":330,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"adff21c4eb1a45d2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Pantry",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":5115,
			"y":-1540,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
